it your request to <a href='mailto:artist@artprice.com'>artist@artprice.com</a>.",m30:"Display ",m31:"Artists",m32:"Events",m33:"Presentation",m34:"Select the section to be in first display in your presentation.",m35:"Tick an option.",m36:"Website address",m37:"Opening hours",m38:"Draft version being saved",m39:"Modify my Artprice Store",m40:"Change images",m41:"OK",m42:"Close",m43:"Modify",m44:"Cancel",m45:"Incorrect image code",m46:"Artist's full name or partial name",m48:"Change information",m47:"Change background image",m15:"For safety reasons your contact details will be displayed to Artprice members only and upon typing of the security code.",m14:"Contact",m13:"Artists",m12:"Presentation",m11:"Events",m10:"Remove from my bookmarked Stores",m9:"Add to my bookmarked Stores",m8:"days",m7:"Marketplace Listings expiring within",m6:"in the last 3 months",m5:"Traffic meter",m4:"Up to 30 letters/digits",m3:"My images",m2:"Only one picture (the 1st) will appear in the marketplace listing summary. The others will be available in the detailed marketplace listing.",m1:"Introduce your Store with a map, a show or a logo etc...",m49:"Search in store: ",m50:"My Artprice Store statistics",m51:"Add or remove artists",m52:"Modify images"}},_contact_store:{html:{m1:"Opening hours",m2:"Fax"}},_left_panel:{html:{m1:"Your search",m2:"Type of Marketplace Listing",m3:"Category",m4:"Artist(s)",m5:"Country",m6:"Medium",m7:"Marketplace Listings posted by",m8:"Narrow your search",m9:"Your search criteria",m10:"Artists",m11:"Medium",m12:"Country",m13:"OK"}},_change_background:{html:{m2:"Select an image",m1:"Select your background image. If need be, resize it."}},_change_artists:{html:{m2:"Add an artist",m1:"Enter the artist's full name or the artist's lastname"}}},auction:{_make_offer:{html:{m6:"Enter your bid",m5:"Currency converter",m4:"We remind you that, according to the general terms and conditions of use and sale of Artprice.com's standardized auction brokerage plaform (Article 4: Purchaser's rights, guarantees and obligations), by bidding up on this lot, you commit yourself to purchase the item if the seller accepts your offer.",m3:"Bid",m2:"I accept the %a%General Conditions of Sale & Use%/a%.",m1:"Bid in #currency#",m7:"I hereby commit myself to following the procedure described in the %a%Auctions user's guide%/a%, which involves the <b>Trusted Third party</b> Escrow.com."}},_show:{html:{m29:"Lot Detail",m31:"To select the trusted third party, you need to accept the General Conditions of Sale & Use.",m28:"Are you sure you want to dismiss this bis?",m27:"Dismiss",m26:"Are you sure you want to select this bidder? Your choice is final",m25:"Confirm",m24:"Please enter the shipping fees",m23:"Are you sure you want to select this bidder? Your choice is final",m22:"Confirm",m21:"Please enter the shipping fees",m20:"Select bidder",m19:"Are you sure you want to select this bidder? Your choice is final",m18:"Select bidder",m17:"Are you sure you want to dismiss this bidder? If you are, the bidder will no longer be able to take part in the auction",m16:"Dismiss bidder",m15:"See bidder's offers",m14:"Your have selected the ##idoffer# offer",m13:"#offers_count# best bids",m12:"Click here to accept the General Conditions of Sale & Use.",m11:"To select the bidder, you need to accept the General Conditions of Sale & Use.",m10:"Starting bid",m9:"In process",m8:"In process",m7:"Additional information",m6:"Delivery to the addressee in person within %distance% km",m5:"Deliver to addressee in person",m4:"Shipping cost",m3:"Insurance",m2:"Weight",m1:"Cost",m30:"The seller has declined your offer.",m32:"Click here to accept the General Conditions of Sale & Use.",m33:"Choose your trusted third party",m34:"The purchaser acknowledges that he/she has freely selected Escrow.com. The Trusted Third Party with full cognisance of their respective offers and with full awareness that the Trusted Third parties are completely independent from ARTPRICE, may not under any circumstances be held liable for or be subject to any claim relating directly or indirectly to the payment of the object of an auction sale.",m35:"You can process the transaction with one of the following trusted third parties:",m36:"Transaction transferred to Trusted Third Party",m37:"Escrow.com",m38:"Covered countries ",m39:"Escrow.com's fees start at $10 / €10",m40:"Escrow.com's commissions",m41:"Process the transaction with Escrow.com",m42:"Transpact: transactions in €, £ and $",m43:"Covered countries",m44:"Transpact's fees start at €6,98 / £5,98 / $19,98 (no percentage fees)",m45:"Go to Transpact.com's detailed fees",m46:"Process the transaction with Transpact.com",m47:"Upon receipt of the item, you will have to instruct a money transfer of €/£/$0.01 to Transpact.com in order to confirm the release of the funds (this amount will be immediately credited back).",m48:"The auction was conducted in £. Escrow.com only supports transactions in US$ and €, please select: ",m49:"NEW: transactions in €",m50:"Select the currency in which the transaction will be processed on Escrow.com:",m51:"No bids listed",m52:"from",m53:"to",m54:"Cancel",m55:"For personal delivery, enter 0",m56:"Before you can bid, you need to enter your address",m57:"Please note: you are currently the highest bidder!"}},_dates:{html:{m15:"To be published",m14:"Auction starts on ",m13:"Auction ends on ",m12:"s",m11:"min",m10:"h",m9:"d",m8:"Auction ends in",m7:"Auction starts on ",m6:"Auction ends on ",m5:"s",m4:"min",m3:"h",m2:"d",m1:"Auction ends in"}},form:{_form_seller:{html:{m19:"Starting bid",m18:"Therefore, we recommend that you offer an attractive starting bid knowing that you won't be committed to accept the offers you will be presented at the end of the auction.",m17:"A starting bid out of proportion with the artist's prices <a id='link_artist' href='#' style='display:none'></a> may jeopardize the success of your auction marketplace listing.<br />Artprice subscribers will bid accordingly to the artist's past auction records, which they can access through their subscription. <br />",m16:"Starting bid",m15:"Additional information",m14:"Weight",m13:"Number of parcels",m12:"Insurance",m11:"Please specify within which distance (in km) you accept to make a delivery to the addressee in person.",m10:"Deliver to addressee in person",m9:"Shipping cost",m8:"Cost",m7:"Shipping and delivery",m6:"Your time zone could not be determined. Please choose it from the above list. The default time zone will be (GMT+00:00) UTC.",m5:"Time zone",m4:"First choose the auction start date.<br />Then you will be able to select the end date: the duration cannot be less than 3 days and more than 14 days.",m3:"Auction end",m2:"Auction start",m1:"Auction dates",m20:"You may choose the currency in which the bids will be submitted. Prices in &euro;, £ and $ will be displayed based upon daily currency exchange rate.<br> <br>Please do not use commas, dots or spaces when entering the price.<br>",m22:"&nbsp;",m21:"We only accept artworks which value is equal or superior to €/$100.",m23:"Caution! To post more than 3 Marketplace Listings, you must have an Artprice Store.",m24:"See the subscription plans with Artprice Store"}}},_details:{html:{m3:"Starting bid",m2:"In process",m1:"In process"}},_price:{html:{m3:"Starting bid",m2:"In process",m1:"In process"}},_countdown:{html:{m9:"Auction ends in",m10:"Auction ends in",m1:"days",m2:"day",m3:"hours",m4:"hour",m5:"minutes",m6:"minute",m7:"seconds",m8:"second"}},_customer_offer:{html:{m2:"Your bid",m1:"Your bid"}},_make_offer_btn:{html:{m3:"You are not allowed to bid on a lot that you posted",m2:"No buyer's premium",m1:"Bid in #currency#"}}},fineart:{form:{_descriptive_details:{html:{m21:"Size of the artwork",m22:"Overall Framed Size",m24:"Please indicate the height of the artwork (whether the framed or image size)",m23:"The size of the artwork is bigger than the overall framed size.",m20:"Unit",m19:"length",m18:"Width",m17:"height",m16:"Stamped by",m15:"Sealed by",m14:"Stamp",m13:"Seal",m12:"Please remember that the only prints accepted on Artprice.com's marketplace are original prints with an identified and numbered edition, and hand-signed by the artist.",m11:"Signature",m10:"Manufacture",m9:"Publisher",m8:"Foundry",m7:"Number and/or edition",m6:"Medium",m5:"Fine art category*",m4:"If you wish to give further details on the date of creation, add them to the fields &quot;Comments&quot; or &quot;Movement/period&quot;.",m3:"Date of creation",m2:"Up to 60 characters.<br>If left blank, the work title will appear as &quot;untitled&quot;.",m1:"Title",m25:"Yes",m26:"Foundry date",m27:"Date of publication",m28:"Size"}},_artwork_description:{html:{m5:"Type of Artwork",m4:"Up to 60 characters",m3:"Movement/period",m2:"Subject",m1:"Condition of the artwork"}}},_show:{html:{m15:"Artist",m16:"Title",m17:"Year",m18:"Category",m19:"Medium",m20:"Size",m21:"Subject",m22:"Artistic Movement",m23:"Observations",m14:"All the marketplace listings in this Artprice Store",m13:"Copy/reproduction",m12:"Multiple",m11:"Original artwork",m10:"Catalogue raisonné reference",m9:"Authentication certificate",m8:"Frame",m7:"Signature",m6:"Certificate of ownership",m5:"Number and/or edition",m4:"All the artworks on the Marketplace",m3:"The prices of",m2:"Posted on:",m1:"Lot #",m24:"Porcelain makers mark",m25:"Marketplace Listing #"}},square:{_classified:{html:{m4:"Details",m3:"Bid",m2:"Untitled",m1:"Untitled",m5:"Submitted to Trusted Third Party"}}},large:{_classified:{html:{m5:"Browse the Store",m4:"Price",m3:" Detailed marketplace listing ",m2:"Untitled",m1:"The artist's prices "}}},carousel:{_classified:{html:{m2:"Browse the Store",m1:"Untitled"}}}},form:{_original_encart:{html:{m7:"New edition",m8:"Type of item",m9:"Original",m13:"Copy/reproduction",m12:"Copy/reproduction",m11:"VIDE Ne pas traduire",m10:"Period piece",m6:"Facsimiles, mouldings from a cast, copies or other reproductions of an artwork or of collector's item are not accepted on the Artprice.com marketplace",m5:"Copy/reproduction",m4:"Multiple",m3:"Original artwork",m2:"Type of edition",m1:"Type of Artwork",m14:"refers to multiple reproductions that are limited in number and authorized by the artist or his/her assignees",m15:"refers to prints or reprints of an artwork that are not limited in number"}},html:{m1:"To post a marketplace listing, you must enable Javascript.",m2:"To activate Javascript, please do as instructed below:",m3:"Draft saved",m4:"Delete draft",m9:"You have a draft marketplace listing pending. Do you want to resume?",m8:"Next",m7:"Please make sure all the fields are properly filled out. You will then be able to proceed.",m6:"Previous",m5:"Confirm",m10:"Image transfer in progress. Please wait for the end of the transfer before moving on to the next step."},_artist:{html:{m4:"Artist's full name or partial name",m5:"Click here to select other artist",m6:"Designer",m8:"If the artist is not listed in our index yet, please send <b>his/her name, birthdate and any proof of his/her exhibitions</b> to <a class='moz-txt-link-abbreviated' href='mailto:artist@artprice.com'>artist@artprice.com</a> and our teams will add him/her (<i>subject to acceptance</i>).",m7:"No exact match for your artist search: '%search%'. ",m3:"(pursuant to Decree No 81-255 of 3 March 1981 on prevention of fraud regarding transactions of artworks and of pieces of collection)",m2:"The Artprice.com Marketplace only accepts original artworks “from” or “made by” the artist abovementioned. “Workshop of”, “school of”, “in the taste of”, “style of”, “in the way of”, “sort of”, “inspired by”; “technics of” are not accepted.",m1:"Artist",m9:"Select a creator",m10:"Required information"}},_rotate_or_crop_modal:{html:{m3:"Resize",m2:"Save",m1:"Resize or rotate image",m4:"Cancel"}},_form_image:{m1:"Add one to five images",html:{m2:"Important: PDF or Word files are not accepted!<br>Please submit image files only (JPG, GIF, PNG, BMP, TIFF...) .<br>The images will be uploaded after clicking on 'Submit'",m1:"In addition to giving a quality overview of the artwork, you can upload images of details, such as the back of the artwork, signature, numbers and distinctives (seal, stamp...), as well as give additional details on the state of preservation.",m3:"Resize or rotate image",m4:"At least one of the images must be centered on your artwork. To crop your images easily, use the 'Resize / Rotate' button."}},m1:"Please use a '.' to separate the units from the decimals.",_type_selection:{html:{m5:"Antiques",m4:"Art",m3:"Design",m1:"Auction Marketplace Listing"}},_form_seller:{html:{m11:"Display my telephone number",m10:"Tel (daytime)",m9:"County",m8:"State ",m7:" Country",m6:" City",m5:"ZIP code",m4:"Address",m3:"Reminder: this email address will be the main address you will use during the whole transaction process, included on the trusted third party's website.",m2:"E-mail*",m1:"Your details"}},_comment_control:{html:{m3:"No URL, logos or links to any website or services. ",m2:"Use this field to provide further details about the artwork: provenance, conservation, bibliography, ... (up to 255 characters). ",m1:"Comments"}},_dimensions:{html:{m4:"Unit",m3:"Depth",m2:"Width",m1:"height",m5:"HxWxD"}},_garantie:{html:{m7:"Catalogue raisonné reference",m6:"Issued by",m5:"Bill/Invoice",m4:"It is recommended that you attach a picture of the COA in 'Images'.Not providing a certificate or providing an inappropriate document may raise questions about the lot's authenticity.",m3:"Certificate of authenticity issued by",m2:"Certificate of authenticity",m1:"Supporting documents",m8:"An artist's catalogue raisonné is a publication edited by a specialist –curator, scholar, academic, artist's heir, or appraiser–, that is meant to reproduce the body of work of the artist.",m9:"Invoice issued by",m10:"Certificate issued by"}},_descriptive_details:{html:{m1:"Description",m2:"If you know at least the first 3 letters of the artist's surname, you can use our artists index!<br> <br> To reference a new artist, please complete and submit the form <a href='/contact/thanks/423'>HERE</a>*.<br> <br> *<i>Subject to acceptance</i>"}},cgv:{m1:"I hereby commit myself to following the procedure described in the %a%Auctions user's guide%/a%, which involves an escrow service available in English only, to be chosen by the seller.",m2:"I have read and accept the General Conditions of Sale & Use."},auctioneers_info:{m1:"If you wish to promote your auctions on our database, please send all the auction information to: <a href='mailto:catalog@artprice.com'>catalog@artprice.com</a>"},m2:"Put you artworks for sale on our Marketplace",m3:"Catalogue raisonné",m4:"Reference",_form:{m2:"I hereby acknowledge and accept the %link1%Terms and conditions of use and sale%/a% as well as my %link2% rights and obligations as a user of the Artprice Marketplace%/a%"}},free:{_login_or_captcha:{html:{m3:"Incorrect code",m4:"OK",m2:"Imagecode",m1:"Contact the seller",m5:"To contact the seller, first enter the characters shown in the image below and submit the information",m8:"Please enter your address to contact the seller",m6:"See all the Marketplace Listings posted by %store%",m7:"Sell all the Marketplace Listings posted in this Artprice Store"}},_show:{html:{m14:"Detailed Marketplace Listing",m15:"Contact",m13:"Tel (daytime)",m12:"State ",m11:"County",m10:"Country",m9:" City",m8:"by Email",m7:"through your Buyers/Sellers Channel",m6:"Price",m5:"Lot number",m4:"Country",m3:"Event date",m2:"Auction title",m1:"Artprice Marketplace Listings"}},form:{_form_seller:{html:{m4:" Artprice has designed a dedicated channel to communicate without giving your email address. <u>Benefit:</u> this channel will block unappropriate communications. You can nevertheless share your email address at anytime over the course of the transaction.<br> To view your messages, click on My Mailbox.",m3:"Contact",m2:"Price",m1:"Price",m5:"You may choose the currency in which the bids will be submitted. Prices in &euro;, £ and $ will be displayed based upon daily currency exchange rate.<br> <br>Please do not use commas, dots or spaces when entering the price.<br>"}}},_contact:{html:{m7:"Contact this member",m6:"Telephone",m5:"State ",m4:"County",m3:"City",m2:"Email address",m1:"Artprice Marketplace Listings"}},contact:{m1:"Your message was sent",m2:"Send"},show:{contact:{m6:"See conversation",m5:"See seller's %count% marketplace listings",m4:"See seller's %count% marketplace listings for %artist%",m3:"Seller since %date%",m2:"Contact the seller",m1:"Contact the seller:",m7:"Send",m8:"Log in to contact the seller",m9:"Enter your message here",m10:"Please login to view contact details",m11:"View contact details",m12:"This is an overview of your Marketplace Listing. This contact feature is active to members viewing your Marketplace Listing."},m13:"Seller status"}},message:{_inbox:{html:{m1:"Date",m2:"Subject",m3:"Answer",m4:"Add to my contacts",m5:"Delete",m7:"From",m6:"Remove from My Contacts",m8:"Re-establish",m9:"No message"}},_left_panel:{html:{m1:"Incoming messages",m2:"Sent messages",m3:"Deleted messages",m4:"My Contacts"}},_modal:{html:{m1:"Send",m2:"Cancel",m3:"Reply",m4:"Delete",m5:"Add to my contacts",m6:"Close",m7:"Re-establish"}},_sent:{html:{m1:"Date",m2:"Subject",m3:"To"}},_trash:{html:{m1:"Date",m2:"Subject",m3:"To",m4:"Delete all"}},contacts:{html:{m5:"Name",m7:"Notes",m8:"New Message",m9:"Edit",m10:"Delete",m4:"There is no data matching your advanced search criteria.",m3:"All",m2:"All",m1:"All"}},index:{m1:"Are you sure you want to delete this conversation?",m2:"Your customer service.",m3:"Reply",m4:"New",m5:"Mark as read",m6:"No messages to show",m7:"Search a message"}},not_fineart:{form:{_artwork_description:{html:{m3:"Additional information",m2:"Restoration",m1:"Condition"}},_descriptive_details:{html:{m15:"Size",m16:"Date of reproduction",m17:"Stamp",m18:"Porcelain makers mark",m19:"Seal",m20:"Seal",m21:"Edition",m14:"Number of item(s)",m13:"Signature",m12:"Manufacturer / Brand / Edition",m11:"Material",m10:"The items advertised in the Antiques section must be connected to one of the 4 categories (Furniture, Lighting, Architectural items, Ceramics-Glass) and to a period. Make sure you also identify the item's style and country of origin. We recommend that you add as many details as you can to better describe the item you advertise. This will constitute an identity card automatically translated into 5 different languages and enhance the visibility of your marketplace listing.",m9:"If you cannot describe your item and post your Marketplace Listing, please contact Customer Care <a href='mailto:marketplace@artprice.com'>marketplace@artprice.com</a>.",m8:"Origin",m7:"Style",m6:"Period",m5:"Category",m4:"Select main headings*",m3:"Date of creation",m2:"Up to 60 characters.<br>If left blank, the work title will appear as &quot;untitled&quot;.",m1:"Title"}}},square:{_classified:{html:{m3:"Bid",m4:"Details",m2:"Untitled",m1:"Untitled"}}},_show:{html:{m20:"Title",m21:"Year",m22:"Size",m23:"Artistic movement",m19:"All the marketplace listings in this Artprice Store",m18:"Restoration",m17:"Condition",m16:"Number of item(s)",m15:"Manufacturer / Brand / Edition",m14:"Execution",m13:"Material",m12:"Catalogue raisonné reference",m11:"Authentication certificate",m10:"Frame",m9:"Signature",m8:"Certificate of ownership",m7:"Untitled",m6:"Origin",m5:"Period",m4:"Style",m3:"Category",m2:"Posted on:",m1:"Lot #"}},carousel:{_classified:{html:{m2:"Browse the Store",m1:"Untitled"}}}},_actions:{html:{m9:"Delete Marketplace Listing",m10:"Please confirm you want to delete the Marketplace Listing",m11:"Yes",m12:"No",m13:"Use this menu to manage your Marketplace Listing",m14:"Manage Marketplace Listing",m8:"Put on hold",m7:"Put on display",m6:"Remove",m5:"Renew Marketplace Listing",m4:"Renew Auction",m3:"Post as a Marketplace Listing",m2:"Post as a lot for auction",m1:"Modify",m15:"Are you sure you want to permanently delete your marke