 converted"}},store_controller:{m2:"My Ongoing Marketplace Listings",m3:"List",m4:"Untitled"},show:{html:{m24:"Latest researches",m25:"Clear",m23:"You must accept the terms",m22:"Confirm Marketplace Listing",m21:"Modify your marketplace listing",m20:"I accept the General Conditions of Sale & Use.",m19:"Check the Marketplace Listing and submit it",m18:"Check the Marketplace Listing and submit it",m17:"Untitled",m16:"Post a Marketplace Listing",m15:"The auction process step by step",m14:"Suggestions for your transactions",m13:"List of marketplace listings",m12:"Back to Homepage",m11:"Artprice.com Customer Care - The Marketplace",m10:"Sincerely yours,",m9:"click here.",m8:"Be aware that you might be contacted by people with fraudulent intentions. <br>To view some examples,",m7:"You will be notified by email each time a Marketplace Listing is published.<br><br>  You will be contacted directly by people interested in your Marketplace Listing.",m6:"&nbsp;",m5:"&nbsp;",m4:"View your Marketplace Listings history and check their status on your account. Go to the menu <b>My Artprice</b>&nbsp;:<br> <ul> <li><u>If you hold an Artprice Store</u>, you will find your marketplace listings under '<b>My Artprice Store</b>'&nbsp;;</li> <li><u>if you are an Artprice member</u>, you will find your marketplace listings under '<b>My account</b>' - go to the section 'Marketplace Listings / Auctions' and click on '<b>My Marketplace Listings and Auctions</b>'.",m3:"Your Marketplace Listing will be <b>posted within 2 to 3 business days</b> in the matching section:<ul><li><u>If you are an Artprice member</u> - your Marketplace Listings will displayed during 90 days on our website;</li><li><u>If you hold an Artprice Store</u> - your Marketplace Listings will be displayed until you cancel it (within the duration of your Artprice Store);",m2:"Your marketplace listing has been successfully submitted.",m1:"Dear Customer,",m26:"The publication of your Marketplace Listing will be effective within 2 to 3 business days. We will send you a confirmation email when your Marketplace Listing is online.",m27:"Your Classified Marketplace Listings will displayed during 90 days on our website.",m28:"Your Marketplace Listing will be displayed until you cancel it (within the duration of your Artprice Store).",m29:"Biddings will start on the date and for the duration you have just determined."}},how_to:{html:{m9:"Next",m8:"Previous",m7:"Artprice.com's auction service fee",m6:"Escrow.com",m5:"Transpact.com",m4:"3. The Trusted Third Party",m3:"2. You are buying an artwork",m2:"1. You are selling an artwork",m1:"Auctions user's guide"}},_add_remove_favorite:{html:{m4:"Remove from my Watch List",m3:"Remove from my Watch List",m2:"Add to my Watch List",m1:"Add to my watch list"}},make_offer:{js:{m3:"This auction has ended",m2:"Having failed to comply with our General Conditions of Sale & Use, you can not bid on lots offered on the Artprice.com marketplace.",m1:"You are not allowed to bid on a lot that you posted"}},info:{html:{m45:"Email",m43:"FAQ & Contact",m44:"Call +33 (0)472 421 701 / +33 (0)472 429 074",m42:"Need more information?",m41:"Submit an Artpricing request",m40:"Unlimited access subscription plans",m39:"Subscription plans with Artprice Store",m38:"For %prices% per artwork and within 72h, a team of specialists will work on the data you submitted and return you an estimated price range updated at the date of the order.",m37:"Artpricing - your artwork estimate established by our inhouse specialists",m36:"an unlimited access annual plan including images starting at %prices%",m35:"the One-Day Access at %prices%",m34:"Compare your artworks with other items that were auctioned to help you determine its market value. To access detailed auction records, subscribe",m33:"Determine the value of your artwork yourself with an access to the price databases",m32:"$199 / &euro;149 per year only",m31:"Access the full list of the lots you put up for auction",m30:"Change your classified Marketplace Listings into lot for electronic auctions in just a few clicks.",m29:"Modify your Marketplace Listings, cancel them or put them on hold when need be",m28:"1 year of unlimited Marketplace Listings",m27:"A professional space where to manage your Marketplace Listings and Auctions",m26:"Artprice Store - your interactive online gallery",m25:"To make the most out of your auction offer or Marketplace Listings, Artprice recommends:",m24:"Artprice.com Terms and Conditions of Use and Sale",m23:"Post a Marketplace Listing now",m22:"Artprice.com Terms and Conditions of Use and Sale",m21:"Auction an artwork now",m19:"Your classified Marketplace Listing stays online during 90 days.",m20:"Artprice.com's Standardized Marketplace® is your chance to make our client file of 5.4 million members your core business. As they can all list their favorite artists, you are sure that your Marketplace Listing will be followed worldwide by the very art lovers, collectors, professionals and institutions that seek to buy the artist's artworks.",m18:"Potential buyers contact you directly by email or via Artprice's message system: you manage the whole transaction yourself from one end to the other.",m17:"Your transaction 100% free of charge: posting your classified marketplace listing is free and Artprice does not take any commission on the transactions.",m16:"Post it as a classified marketplace listing:",m14:"How to auction an artwork and bid",m15:"Artprice.com's Standardized Marketplace® is your chance to make our client file of 5.4 million members your core business. As they can all list their favorite artists, you are sure that your auction will be followed worldwide by the very art lovers, collectors, professionals and institutions that seek to buy the artist's artworks.",m13:"You remain anonymous during the whole duration of the auction.",m12:"You really know the real value of an artwork after it has been put up for auction!",m11:"Watch the price of your artwork soar!",m9:"With Artprice auctions, your secure payment is released faster than on any other sales channel.",m10:"The most competitive fees on the market, ranging from 5% to 9% only.",m8:"<b>Your transaction 100% under control</b>: Set your auction offer details (start price, dates the auction starts and ends) and select your buyer out of the 3 best final bids.",m7:"the payment of your item is guaranteed by our trusted third parties' online escrow services.",m6:"Your transaction 100% secure",m4:"Submit your artwork for auction",m5:"Artprice is an infrastructure enabling electronic auction brokerages ('article 5 de la loi n° 2011-850 du 20 juillet 2011')",m3:"Select your selling option:",m2:"Post as many Marketplace Listings as you want, to put your ART, DESIGN and ANTIQUES items and works up for sale: the publication of your Marketplace Listings is free!",m1:"Sell your artworks on the standardised marketplace (Place de Marché Normalisée®) of Artprice, the world leader in art market information!",m46:"Post as many Marketplace Listings as you want, to put your ART, DESIGN and ANTIQUES items and works up for sale on the Standardised Marketplace® Artprice.com: it's both unlimited and free&nbsp;! <br><br>",m48:"Post your marketplace listings quickly and easily on Artprice.com&nbsp;:<br><br><ul> <li>In tab <b>Sell an Artwork</b>, fill in the form with the specifics of the artwork and <b>download up to 5 images</b></li><br> <li> Check the elements of your marketplace listing then confirm the publication, and it will be <b>online within 48 working hours</b>.</li><br><br> </ul>The buyers will contact you directly on the mailbox you choose&nbsp;:<br><br>On your personal email, or on your Artprice.com mailbox which is more secure.<br> <br> <b> You can manage your transactions and your marketplace listings at your pace, it's both unlimited and free&nbsp;!</b> <br><br> <br>",m49:"Artprice.com offers a standardized auction service.",m50:"Your anonymity will be maintained throughout the auction.",m51:"Choose the bid that best matches your expectations: you are presented the best three bids with the bidders' locations.",m52:"No bid satisfies your expectations? You can reject all offers, you will not be charged a fee.",m53:"Further information:",m54:"How to auction an artwork and bid",m55:"Post your marketplace listings quickly and easily.",m56:"Potential buyers will contact you directly on the mailbox you will choose (your personal email, or on your Artprice.com mailbox, which is more secure).",m57:"Manage your transactions and your marketplace listings at your own pace",m58:"Post as many marketplace listings as you want to put your ART, DESIGN and ANTIQUES items and works up for sale on Artprice.com's standardized Marketplace®!",m59:"Subscribe to Artprice Store and enjoy professional tools to boost your sales."}},store_stats:{m1:"Where do your visitors come from?",m2:"Over the past month",m3:"Over the past three months",m4:"Which of your marketplace listings got more traffic?"},home:{index:{m1:"Buy an artwork on the marketplace",m2:"Marketplace highlights",m3:"For sale on the Standardized Marketplace",m4:"%count% artworks match your search criteria",m5:"All Artprice Stores",m6:"All Marketplace Listings",m7:"Price",m8:"Date"}},partials:{common:{message:{m1:"Delete conversation",m2:"Mark as read",m3:"Mark as unread",m4:"Send",m5:"Publication pending",m6:"Do you really want to delete this conversation?"},auction_timeline:{m1:"The auction is ongoing. We will send you an email when new bids are posted.",m2:"No bids listed",m3:"You have accepted the offer %idoffer% (%detail%).",m4:"The auction has ended. Discover the bid(s) and accept or decline!",m5:"The buyer has chosen the escrow service that will secure the payment. Go to %link_to_partner% to sign up and proceed with the transaction.",m6:"The buyer has yet to choose the escrow service that will secure the payment. We will send you an email as soon as the transaction is initiated.",m7:"Transaction canceled",m8:"The payment is in escrow.",m9:"Transaction pending payment",m10:"Transaction ended. The payment will be transfered to your account in next few days.",m11:"Contact the buyer (%buyer_email%) to arrange delivery.",m12:"After the artwork is shipped out, go to %link_to_partner%: click on 'merchandise shipped' and list the carrier and tracking number*.",m13:"*Or choose 'other'",m14:"Once the buyer has received the artwork, please ask the buyer to release the funds through %link_to_partner% so as to receive your payment.",m15:"Your offer was accepted.",m16:"The offer you submitted is on hold. When the auction ends, the seller will have the possibilty to accept or refuse it.",m17:"You were outbid, or your bid was not high enough. Do not lose the auction - bid higher now!",m18:"The seller has denied you the possibility to participate in this sale.",m19:"Your offer was not accepted",m20:"Register or log in to Escrow.com (the Trusted third party) that will secure your payment for the artwork.",m21:"Thank you for choosing your escrow service! Please go to %link_to_partner% to register and proceed with your payment.",m22:"Transaction cancelled",m23:"Payment is in escrow",m24:"Payment of transaction pending.",m25:"Transaction is complete. The funds will be transfered to the seller's account within the next few days.",m26:"Contact the seller at %seller_email% to make arrangements for delivery of the artwork.",m27:"Once the artwork delivered, please mention it on your %link_to_partner% account and click on 'merchandise received'.",m28:"Once the artwork is delivered, please go to %link_to_partner% to release the funds",m29:"Go to the detailed Marketplace Listing and:<br> -reselect an offer to re-initiate the transaction<br> -or decline all offers to put the artwork up for sale again"},details:{m1:"Account verification documents to be submitted"}},seller:{classifiednotification:{m1:"Your marketplace listing could not be published for the following reasons:",m2:"You have left the marketplace listing form incomplete",m3:"You have put this Marketplace Listing on hold"}}},common:{sub_menu:{m1:"Online",m2:"Pending modification",m3:"Incoming bids",m4:"Expired",m5:"Wishlist",m6:"My biddings",m7:"Winning bids"},managmentmenu:{m1:"List of messages",notification:{m1:"Your marketplace listings cannot be published until your seller profile has been validated. Please click here to complete the seller form."}}},square:{m1:"Remove from Wishlist"},searchbars:{common:{facetsselect:{m1:"No match found - please modify your search criteria"},artist:{m1:"Artist",m2:"Search an artist",m3:"No matching artist",m4:"Please select an artist",m5:"Loading artists"},countries:{m1:"Country",m2:"Select country(ies)"},storegroupments:{m1:"Type of seller",m2:"Select type(s) of sellers"},state:{m1:"State ",m2:"Select state(s)"},city:{m1:"City",m2:"Select city(ies)"},professionaltypes:{m1:"Select the type of account",m2:"Type of seller"},storetypes:{m1:"Type of Store",m2:"Select the type of Store"}},classifieds:{bar:{m1:"Advanced search",m2:"Apply",m3:"Clear all search fields",m4:"Marketplace Listings",m5:"Sellers",m6:"Sort",m7:"Display preferences",categories:{m1:"Categories",m2:"Select category(ies)"},classifiedauctionmodes:{m1:"Type of Marketplace Listing",m2:"Marketplace Listings"},display:{m1:"Currency",m2:"Size unit"},techniques:{m1:"Media",m2:"Select media"},shapes:{m1:"Orientation",m2:"Sort by orientation"},sizes:{m1:"Size",m2:"Sort by size"},m8:"Keyword(s)",m9:"Price",m10:"Between",m11:"And",m12:"Select the currency",m13:"Artworks by my favorite artists",m14:"Filter"}},stores:{bar:{m1:"Clear all search fields",m2:"Artists",m3:"Sellers",m4:"%count% Artprice stores match your search criteria",m5:"Keyword(s)"}}},_classified_squares:{html:{m1:"Thank you for taking a moment to answer this mini survey."}},sellermenu:{m1:"My Store",m2:"Online",m3:"Pending modification",m4:"Expired",m5:"Incoming bids",m6:"My biddings",m7:"Winning bids",m8:"Modify my Store",m9:"My Store",m10:"My Marketplace Listings",m11:"Auctions",m12:"Modify",m13:"Home",m14:"To be published",m15:"Add"},stores:{edit:{form:{m1:"Personalize your Artprice Store",m3:"Presentation",m4:"Contacts",m5:"Artists",m6:"Images",artists:{m1:"Search an artist",m2:"No matching artist",m3:"Please select an artist",m4:"Loading artists"},contact:{m1:"Email",m2:"Company name",m3:"Address",m4:"Zip code",m5:"City",m6:"State ",m7:"Country",m8:"Select country",m9:"No match found",m10:"Please select a country",m11:"Phone",m12:"Fax",m13:"Submit"},images:{m1:"Main image",image:{cropper:{m1:"Change image",m2:"Save",m3:"Cancel",m4:"Rotate right",m5:"Rotate left",m6:"Cancel",m7:"Crop"},errors:{m1:"The format of the image that you are uploading is not correct. Please upload a .png, .jpg or .jpeg file.",m2:"Please note your file is too big. File size must be less than 10 Mb",m3:"The resolution of the image is insufficient.",m4:"An error occurred"}}},information:{m1:"Your Store's name",m2:"Occupation",m3:"Select occupation",m4:"No match found",m5:"Please select an occupation",m6:"Events / current exhibitions",m7:"Presentation",m8:"Website",m9:"Opening hours",m10:"Display preferences",m11:"Cover photo",m12:"Submit",m13:"Artists",m14:"Events",m15:"Presentation",m16:"Contact",m17:"You must complete your seller profile to be able to select your activity.",m18:"Confirm your seller profile"}},preview:{m1:"Preview"},m1:"Cancel"},header:{store:{m1:"Please log in to your account to manage your favorite artists"}},stats:{list:{m1:"Country"}},common:{noaccess:{m1:"Restricted access",m2:"To access statistics and analysis of your activity, subscribe to the Artprice Store.",m3:"See our subscription plans"}},list:{m1:"Discover the Artprice Stores",m2:"Access our global network of sellers: Galleries, Art Dealers, Auction Houses, Collectors and Artists!",m3:"Join the Artprice sellers network",m4:"All Artprice Stores",m5:"Artprice, preferred partner for online sales since 2005",m6:"Follow",m7:"Followed",m8:"Find a Store on the Marketplace"}},shapes:{portrait:"Portrait",landscape:"Landscape",square:"Square",other:"Other"},sizes:{large:"Big (over 115 x 115)",medium:"Medium (less than 115 x 115)",small:"Small (under 50 x 50)"},manage:{waiting:{m1:"To sell through our Marketplace, please %a%follow the steps to validate your account.%/a%"}},classifieds:{searchbar:{count:{m1:"%count% artworks match your search criteria",m2:"No match found for your search",m3:"One result found for your search",m4:"%count% artworks for sale on the marketplace"}},form:{m1:"I hereby acknowledge and accept the %link1% as well as my %link2%",m2:"Terms and conditions of use and sale",m3:"rights and obligations as a user of the Artprice Marketplace"}},index:{m1:"Marketplace",m2:"Collect with Artprice",m3:"Explore more than %official_count% artworks available on the Artprice marketplace and grow your collection.",m4:"How to collect",m5:"Collect now",m6:"Artprice auctions",m7:"Bid on painting, drawing, print, photography or design and start your collection with Artprice.",m8:"How to bid",m9:"Bid",m10:"Join our seller’s community",m11:"Sell your art with Artprice.",m12:"How to sell",m13:"Sell now",m14:"Join now",m15:"Artprice Stores",m16:"Discover the Artprice Stores represented by International Galleries, Art Dealers, Auction Houses, or Artists.",m17:"Marketplace subscriptions",m18:"See all Stores",m19:"Works by %artists% on the Marketplace",ldjson:{name:"Artworks for sale on the Artprice Marketplace"},m20:"%category% for sale: original art listings | Artprice",m21:"%categories% for sale on the Artprice Marketplace"},howtobuy:{m1:"%a%Become a member%/a% (it's free!) and find your next work of art or design piece!",m2:"Connect to the Artprice seller community and discover more than <strong>70,000 online</strong> listings.",m3:"The Artprice Marketplace offers a wide variety of art and design works: paintings, sculptures, drawings, prints, and photographs.",m4:"Create an account",m5:"%a%Create%/a% your free account or log in.",m6:"Discover artists from around the world or search for the latest works by your favorite artists.",m7:"Buy an artwork on Artprice.",m8:"Decide on shipping details and receive your artwork.",m9:"Buy artworks on Artprice",m10:"Your advantages",m11:"Discover artists, galleries, and private sellers from all over the world.",m12:"Explore easily with Artprice's advanced search.",m13:"Receive free email alerts on your favorite artists.",m14:"No buyer fees.",m15:"Secure payment on auctions via a trusted third party.",m16:"Customer service available Monday through Friday.",m17:"See the artworks for sale on the Marketplace",m18:"Find your next acquisition on the Artprice Marketplace.",m19:"Find your next artwork or design piece among %official_count% online listings!",m20:"Artprice's Marketplace offers a wide variety of art and design works: paintings, sculptures, drawings, editions, art photographs, and more.",m21:"Find your next artwork or design piece among %official_count% online listings.",m22:"%a1%Create your free account%/a% or %a2%Log in%/a%.",m23:"Contact sellers and track your conversations through your Artprice inbox.",m24:"Buy with no commission fees."},howtosell:{m1:"Sell your artworks with Artprice",m2:"Artists, gallery owners, art dealers, collectors: make our Marketplace your showcase.",m3:"Showcase your artwork on our Marketplace and share your work with 2.7 million art lovers and buyers.",m4:"Create an account",m5:"Start selling",m6:"Sell an artwork",m7:"%a1%Create a free account%/a% or %a2%subscribe%/a% to Artprice Store.",m8:"Create your marketplace listings.",m9:"Choose between auctions or classified marketplace listings.",m10:"Follow offers and respond to potential buyers via your Artprice messaging service.",m11:"Arrange payment and delivery details with the buyer and ship your artwork.",m12:"%s%Auctions%/s%: choose from 3 best bids.",m13:"How much does it cost to sell on Artprice?",m14:"Listing fees: €0",m15:"The transaction is done directly between seller and buyer.",m18:"Your benefits",m19:"Augment your online visibility and interact with your customer base!",m20:"Free member",m21:"Unlimited marketplace listings",m23:"Post 3 marketplace listings max. simultaneously.",m24:"Customer service available Monday through Friday.",m25:"ARTPRICE STORE subscriber",m27:"Publish your marketplace listings.",m28:"Increase your online presence with your personalized Store.",m29:"Track your marketplace listing views and understand what attracts your future buyers.",m30:"Manage your Marketplace listings easily as you negotiate and sell.",m31:"%s%Auctions%/s%: unlimited marketplace listings",m32:"Do you want to estimate your artworks?",m33:"With our %a%Artpricing service%/a%, get a complete estimate report on your artwork within 72 hours for just €72.",m34:"Find your way around your artists' market, use %a%Intuitive ArtMarket ®%/a%.",m35:"Value in %y%",m36:"Choose subscription",m37:"<a href='https://fr.artprice.com/account/confirm'>Complete</a> your seller form.",m38:"Connect with <b>2.7 million</b> art lovers and collectors.",m39:"Discover how the Artprice Store works.",m40:"Read the user guide",m41:"Conduct your own research in our databases (%a1%from 36€%/a%) by exploring comparable works sold at public auctions, and use our %a2%Intuitive ArtMarket®%/a% tools to uncover the latest market trends for your artists.",m42:"The Artprice Store is not limited in any way and allows you to freely generate an unlimited number of sales. It thus offers an unlimited number of marketplace listings with great ease and speed of posting online. The system leaves buyers and sellers completely free in their interaction (with ultimately very little risk of fraud). And with that, no commission is imposed by Artprice in the event of a successful sale. For my part, I have been using the Store for more than 5 years and during this period, I have managed to sell numerous works for tens of thousands of euros in total, which represents a very positive and productive ratio compared to the cost of subscription and service. I have not found a better platform to sell my works online and I have thoroughly explored the market (Artsy, Artnet, Askart, etc.).",m43:"Art Dealer & Expert, France",m44:"My opinion of the Artprice Marketplace is very positive. It allows for a considerable increase in the visibility of the works and instills trust between the potential buyer and the seller. Sales were satisfactory. I think it's a good option to offer works through the Artprice platform.",m45:"Artist, Spain",m46:"Our gallery has been working with artprice.com for many years and we find this platform the best value for money and with the most professional art market buyers.",m47:"Art Gallery, England",m48:"I have been on the Artprice Marketplace for over 10 years, and I am satisfied with it. It is very interesting for me to be able to present my artists' works for sale on one of the best existing media  platforms in the field of Art. Artprice is one of the most important and prestigious companies in the art world. I will continue to collaborate with this company for as long as possible.",m49:"Art Gallery, France",m50:"The fact that my marketplace listings appears on the same page, where the data of the particular artist is published, makes this Marketplace format so valuable to me. Not only does it target specifically potential buyers looking up artists of their interest, but also provides good image and text exposure on the net.",m51:"Antique Dealer, Switzerland",m52:"Great platform, transparent and easy to operate. Professional and fast communication with the artprice team, high mutual trust. Very high quality information about the global art world",m53:"Artist, Serbia",m54:"As a painter, I appreciate the ease with which I was able to present my paintings on Artprice and their promotion on the site. Furthermore, the monitoring of consultation statistics is particularly significant in terms of interest of collectors. What I also really appreciate is knowing, among my paintings, which ones are the most viewed. Finally, some of my collectors found me through Artprice. For a painter, knowing that collectors appreciate you and follow you is the greatest reward.",m55:"Artist, France",m56:"Being recognized and appreciated on Artprice´s Marketplace is a significant step in an artist's career. One becomes thankful to be one of these artists selected in history and in the present day. Artprice provides excellent service and is the most serious and trustworthy platform in the art sector. It is the most prominent platform on the internet for buying and selling art",m57:"Artist, Sweden",m58:"As a painter, I am extremely satisfied with the Artprice.com Marketplace, for all my research as well as for its ease of use. It is an essential tool for keeping up to date with trends in the international art market and for being able to put my work online. In addition, I appreciate the professionalism and excellent responsiveness of the Artprice team.",m59:"Artist, France",m60:"For over ten years, I have offered my work on various online art sales platforms, without ever being satisfied with the attention I received. With the Artprice Marketplace, the change is drastic. Here, artists are valued. Our works are not treated as mere commodities. The interface is clear, the presentation of the artworks is elegant, and the pricing of services is fair. Another advantage: no commission is taken on sales. As for customer support, it is attentive and responsive. Artprice represents me worldwide — on the Artprice Marketplace, I finally feel I’m where I belong.",m61:"Artist, France",tofaq:{m1:"Continue to explore Artprice’s services!",m2:"Visit our FAQ"}},howtobid:{header:{m1:"Sell ​​and bid online with confidence on Artprice",m2:"Artprice auctions have been in service since 2012.",m3:"Start your collection or sell your artworks, furniture, and works of design with Artprice auctions."},advantagesartprice:{m1:"Your advantages with Artprice.com",m2:"Publish an unlimited number of auction marketplace listings",m3:"Diffusion of your marketplace listings via email alerts on favorite artists",m4:"Only 5-9% management fees on your sale",m5:"Customer service is available Monday through Friday"},advantagesescrow:{m1:"Your advantages with",m2:"Escrow.com is the safest way to buy and sell artwork online, protecting both buyer and seller once the auction is won.",m3:"Global Customer Service",m4:"Certified online service",m5:"Verification of the identity of the buyer and the seller",m6:"Buyer inspection period"},auctionprocess:{m1:"Auction process",m2:"The seller puts a work online",m3:"Buyers place their bids",m4:"The seller selects an offer",m5:"Seller and buyer register with the trusted third party"},escrowchecks:{m1:"Avoid fraud and scams",m2:"Thorough buyer and seller verification process to prevent online fraud and scams.",m3:"Inspect and Approve",m4:"Your payment is only released once you have accepted the artwork.",m5:"Secure funds",m6:"Payment is secured with an authorized online escrow service protecting all parties."},protection:{m1:"Protection of all parties to the transaction",m2:"Buyer Protection",m3:"The buyer's funds are secure and are only released to the seller once the commissioned work has been delivered and accepted by the buyer.",m4:"Seller Protection",m5:"The seller is only obligated to send the artworks after the payment is secured by Escrow.com."},transactionprocess:{m1:"Transaction process",m2:"To give you peace of mind, Artprice has partnered with <strong>Escrow.com</strong>, the most trusted online escrow service on the market.",m3:"Seller and buyer accept the terms of the transaction",m4:"Buyer sends payment on Escrow.com",m5:"Escrow.com notifies the seller to arrange shipment of artwork with the buyer",m6:"Buyer receives, inspects and accepts artwork",m7:"Escrow.com releases funds to the seller",m8:"Create an auction",m9:"Go to auctions"},faq:{m1:"Frequently asked questions",m2:"Choose a category",m3:"Read the full user manual",fees:{m1:"Artprice.com's service fees are deducted from the amount paid to the seller.",m2:"No buyer's premium",m3:"Sale amount (US$/€/£)",m4:"Rate",m5:"Calculate service fees on Artprice:",m6:"Service fees",m7:"Price",m8:"Example: for a sale of €25,000 the fees are calculated as follows:",m9:"9% fees on the amount from 0 to €7,500, i.e. 7,500 X 9% = €675",m10:"7% fees on the amount from 7,500.01 to €15,000 i.e. 7,500 X 7% = €525",m11:"5% fees on the amount above €15,000.01 i.e. 10,000 X 5% = €500",m12:"Total fees: 675 + 525 + 500 = €1,700",m13:"Above %nb%"},m4:"Trusted Third Party",m5:"Buyer",m6:"Seller",m7:"Artprice.com service fees",m8:"Back"}},classified:{m1:"See all the artist's works on the Marketplace",actions:{message:{m1:"Send a message",modaleform:{m1:"Your message"}},m1:"%professionaltype% seller"},details:{common:{formattedprice:{m1:"Price upon request"}},m1:"Artwork description",m2:"Read more"},follow:{m1:"Add to favorites",m2:"Delete from favorites"},sameartistandcustomerlist:{m1:"Discover other works by %artistname% sold by %store%",m2:"Discover other works sold by %store%",m3:"Discover other works in %category%",m4:"Discover other works by %artist%"},m2:"Learn more about %artist%",m3:"Do you have a similar work for sale?",m4:"Selling on Artprice"},reporting:{m1:"Report",m2:"You have noticed contentious content or behavior on the Artprice.com Marketplace. You can report it by filling out the form below.",m3:"Purpose of your report",date:{m1:"Date of observation"},description:{m1:"Precise and complete description of the content/behavior in dispute"},documents:{m1:"Supporting documents",m2:"Document N°%nb%",m3:"Add a supporting document",m4:"Submit the company registration document.",m5:"Upload your identity document (ID card, driver's license, or passport)."},phoneinput:{m1:"Phone number"},titledropdown:{m1:"Title"},m4:"Reason",m5:"Specify",m6:"URL of the corresponding page",m7:"Email",m8:"I am",m9:"Company name",m10:"Quality of the legal representative",m11:"First name",m12:"Lastname",m13:"Street address",m14:"Postcode",m15:"City",m16:"Additional information",m17:"Your notification is based on the rights you have as",m18:"Copy of the first withdrawal request addressed to the author of the contentious content/behavior or proof of the impossibility of contacting him",countrydropdown:{m1:"Country"},m19:"I authorize the Artprice.com Company to communicate my contact details (name and email address) to the author of the content/behavior subject to my notification.",m20:"I declare on my honor that I have the right to submit this report and certify that my notification is complete and sincere and that the information provided in this notification is accurate.",m21:"I declare that I have read and accepted the following provisions:",m22:"General Conditions of Use governing the Artprice Marketplace",m23:"Terms and Conditions of Use of this report",m24:"Send",m25:"Please be aware that no commercial dispute concerning a sale or purchase made on the Artprice.com Marketplace will be handled using this report form.",dropdown:{m1:"Select..."},m30:"Report sent on %dt%",m26:"Your report has been taken into account and transmitted to our Marketplace department. It will be processed as soon as possible.",m27:"Information required",m28:"Incorrect format",m29:"'Description' is a required field, please enter at least 5 characters",m31:"The email address entered is invalid. Please follow the format: user@domain.com",m32:"Contact details",country:{}},how:{to:{buy:{title:"Buy art online securely | Artprice",description:"Buy paintings, sculptures, prints and design pieces directly from sellers and galleries around the world. Secure payment, with no buyer fees."},sell:{description:"Sell your artworks on the Artprice Marketplace: easy to list, with buyers and collectors from all over the world, with no middlemen.",title:"Sell an artwork online: valuation and listing | Art